Off path: byte-for-byte the proven sequence (pinned).
Cost (inferred): about 4-6 us per drawing DP2/Clear2 call. That is about 0.2 ms/frame for UT2004 (~35 DP2 calls/frame); DX5-era titles are unmeasured. A generation-gated variant is specified as a follow-up if measurement demands it.
