- Reset3D becomes redundant once this is default-on, because the baseline runs at the point of use and also covers killed clients and display-reset ends.
- G41 (fog-table cache) is the companion for the one cached residue.
- G05/G12/G13/G14/G50/G09/G35/G57/G51 build on D3D owning these registers. G51 must replace sliCtrl=0 and chipMask=ALL with D3D's own SLI values.

