(c) No Glide-free control exists. The 11-12 sessions followed pid 1892's 4-chip OpenGL session. VcrHwResetEngine (vcrmp_hw.c:181-200) pulses reset bits and writes no combine, stencil or chroma register, and G03 shows a stale TMU combineMode rewires the legacy TMU combine. So the defects attributed to G05/G06/G17/G18/G44 must be re-seen in a Glide-free boot before their A/Bs.
